    {
      "text": "What do we know about the estate, and what should we investigate next?",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.785108086469176,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Portfolio Discovery helps you examine sample or imported workloads in the context of",
      "start": 3.785108086469176,
      "end": 8.462930344275422,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "their enterprise evidence.",
      "start": 8.462930344275422,
      "end": 9.444915932746198,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "The Portfolio Discovery specialist uses Gemini to reason about heterogeneous evidence,",
      "start": 9.444915932746198,
      "end": 13.997758206565255,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "relationships, ambiguity, and missing facts.",
      "start": 13.997758206565255,
      "end": 16.943714971977585,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask EMOS provides access to this reasoning.",
      "start": 16.943714971977585,
      "end": 19.371897518014414,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Structured output is validated before it reaches the workflow.",
      "start": 19.371897518014414,
      "end": 23.799759807846282,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Missing evidence remains a gap; a plausible explanation is not a verified fact.",
      "start": 23.799759807846282,
      "end": 28.209767814251407,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "This is not an automatic connection to your live enterprise systems.",
      "start": 28.209767814251407,
      "end": 31.066453162530028,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Review dependencies and prioritized investigations, then inspect Enterprise DNA for the",
